HISTORY the ithaperture in order j can be found as                              HISTORY follows:lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                         HISTORY (i-1)],flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                            HISTORY (i-1)],uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                     HISTORY (i-1)],flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].The spectra         HISTORY in the file(s) spectra0040.fits,                                        HISTORY spectra0041.fits,spectra0044.fits, spectra0045.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0046.fits,spectra0047.fits, spectra0048.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0049.fits,spectra0050.fits, spectra0051.fits were                HISTORY combined using a robustweighted mean with a sigma threshold of          HISTORY 8.  Aperture 1modifications: The scale factors were determined          HISTORY using order 1and are: 0.5172497789664589,                               HISTORY 0.9892526258422714,0.8477573792307876, 0.9025953635844248,              HISTORY 20.182210330651255,4.497131539177923, 1.5550702745587905,               HISTORY 1.0109834608850863,2.0942742916335453, 0.5571416098398851.              END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             